s/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-06-06T17:34:05Z","updated_at":"2022-06-06T17:34:05Z","body":"I'm not sure so it's a bit of a guess at this point, but this might have something to do with `previousNumDeltaPocs` not being updated in [this `if` branch](https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/blob/r2.17.1/library/extractor/src/main/java/com/google/android/exoplayer2/util/NalUnitUtil.java#L779). I think it should be updated to `previousNumDeltaPocs = numNegativePics + numPositivePics` in this branch as well as in the `else` branch, where `numNegativePics` and `numPositivePics` will need to be derived. Rec. ITU-T H.265 v6 (06/2019) Section 7.4.8 describes how to derive these values for the `inter_ref_pic_set_prediction_flag is equal to 1` case. The logic looks reasonably complicated, so I'll have to try and find a bigger piece of time to investigate in more detail.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/1147704084/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28